{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"sup"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Sup. Talk to me, what's happening today?"}]}
{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"good morning"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Morning. You up early or did you just not sleep? Either way, what's the plan?"}]}
